## Context
Child 0 of tracker 1100, table row 0 (about 1.5 agent-h, 0.5 author-h). Plan of record: docs/discussions/2026-10-14-1096-design.md, sections "Answers" and "Round 3". Review-pr, review-pr-prose and gaze-as-gate wording must be repointed to gaze plus verify-gate in every project that still uses them before review-pr is retired (child 3).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Read-only inventory, on padme and on doudou, of the projects whose skills, rules, tickets or AGENTS files name `review-pr`, `review-pr-prose` or treat gaze as the gate; hosts that are unreachable are named, never assumed clean (positive control: the inventory finds the harness's own known references)
- [ ] One PR per affected project repointing the wording to gaze plus verify-gate; writes are authorized for this purpose only; no stub skill, no alias
- [ ] Each PR merged or consciously dropped by the author, listed in the tracker
- [ ] Doudou is part of the sweep: run it once doudou is up
